      "text": "The new literal path lacks a CRLF preservation test, and SQLite 3.51.0 `.read` changes parameter text `a\\r\\nb` into `a\\nb`, corrupting replay values. Fix: use hexadecimal CASTs for CRLF text and add a native replay regression test."
